getData [SimTalk]
Returns the data which the GanttChart designated by <Path> shows and writes it to a table.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.getData(DataTable:table)
Parameter
The parameter DataTable of data type table designates the table into which Plant Simulation writes data
that the GanttChart shows.
The format of the data table is described under setData.
Example
MyGanttChart.getData(MyGanttDataTable)
SimTalk
