getLanes [SimTalk]
Returns the lanes which you defined for the GanttChart designated by <Path>.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.getLanes(TableToWrite:table)
Parameter
The parameter TableToWrite of data type table designates the table into which Plant Simulation writes
lanes of the GanttChart.
A lane is defined by the settings Top and Height. Both have the data type integer.
Example
MyGanttChart.getLanes(MyLanesTable)
SimTalk
