setLanes [SimTalk]
Sets the lanes which the GanttChart designated by <Path> is to show.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.setLanes(TableToRead:table)
Parameter
The parameter TableToRead of data type table designates the table which contains the lanes that the
GanttChart shows.
A lane is defined by the settings Top and Height. Both have the data type integer.
